DESCRIPTION:NO CIGAR are bringing their brand of ‘semi rock’ to Austral
 ia this spring\, with thirteen lively shows on the cards for their biggest
  run in Australia to date . NO CIGAR have carved out a unique niche blendi
 ng indie\, surf\, and alternative rock into a sound that's as rhythm-drive
 n as it is emotionally resonant\, earning a fiercely loyal following acros
 s Australia\, the UK\, the US and Europe. They are no strangers to the Aus
 tralian shores and audiences\, making this their fourth headline excursion
  across the ditch. Spanning the breadth of their catalogue\, the show will
  likely include a few unreleased numbers\, giving Australia the first snea
 k peak of what’s next for NO CIGAR.
